OL,3,GNEWSAHomework clubs and mentors aim to
OL,4,Aclose grade gap
OL,5,
OL,6,FFree homework clubs and university
OL,7,Fmentors are some of the tools being
OL,8,Fused to try to improve A-level results
OL,9,Fin north-east England.
OL,11,FThe gap in the proportion of top
OL,12,FA-level grades achieved by youngsters
OL,13,Fbetween the North East and London has
OL,14,Fgrown to its largest level since the
OL,15,FCovid-19 pandemic, says charity Schools
OL,16,FNorth East.
OL,18,FBut it says this gap is more
OL,19,Fsignificant in parts of the North East,
OL,20,Fwith Hartlepool and Sunderland
OL,21,Fperforming poorly.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
