OL,3,GNEWSAHomework clubs and mentors aim to
OL,4,Aclose grade gap
OL,5,
OL,6,FEducation charity IntoUniversity, which
OL,7,Fopened a branch in Hartlepool last
OL,8,Fyear, said it was confident its efforts
OL,9,Fwould help close the grade gap. Skills
OL,10,Fminister Jacqui Smith said the
OL,11,Fgovernment was also "absolutely
OL,12,Fdetermined" to achieve this.
